(text "Samsung AC IR controller - reference build, traced from a working breadboard 2026-11-21.\nFirmware settings of this build (ESPHome): GPIO21 = remote_transmitter, 38 kHz, carrier_duty_percent 90%.\nGPIO20 = remote_receiver, inverted, internal pull-up on. Logger on USB_SERIAL_JTAG frees GPIO20/21.\nR1, R2, R3 measured with a multimeter. Q1 marking 2N2222A-1726, legs traced E-B-C.\nU1 pin numbers in this symbol are ids only, not physical pads (no PCB footprint assigned)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 129.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8b478021-3700-5a4b-bf8c-3fb1809bdce0"))
